{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14678","headline":"暮春游长沙东湖赠辛兖州巢父二首 一 · 戴叔伦","name":"暮春游长沙东湖赠辛兖州巢父二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘流分曲浦，缭绕古城东。\n岸转千家合，林开一镜空。\n人生无事少，心赏几回同。\n且复忘羁束，悠悠落照中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}